sequenceDiagram
  actor Player
  participant Portal
  participant Host as Event/team authorization
  participant Problem as Owned verifier or scoring adapter
  participant DB as Persistent store
  Player->>Portal: Submit declared answer or checkpoint
  Portal->>Host: Team-authenticated request
  Host->>Host: Check event, problem, time and access
  Host->>Problem: Verify only against retained environment
  Problem-->>Host: Valid verdict or explicit error
  Host->>Host: Recheck deadline and operation state
  Host->>DB: Atomically save score, progress and receipt
  Host-->>Portal: Verdict and durable result
